{"id":"76efdf35dc96e34a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CNodes.md","title":"CNodes","display":"CNodes","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CNodes","parameters":["E","U"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CNodes"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>U</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>U</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CNodes E U)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ CConstraints E)\n  (and\n    (@ Finite U)\n    (forall x\n      (iff\n        (in x U)\n        (or\n          (exists z (and (@ Num0 z) (@ TBase z x)))\n          (exists a\n            (exists b\n              (and (exists z1725 (and (@ Pair a b z1725) (in z1725 E))) (or (@ MTSubterm x a) (@ MTSubterm x b))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d1838ae56b7f2fbc\" href=\"?note=d1838ae56b7f2fbc\" title=\"ZFC_CConstraints\">CConstraints</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee0b315916cb8bff\" href=\"?note=ee0b315916cb8bff\" title=\"ZFC_Finite\">Finite</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98478f4f032f47cf\" href=\"?note=98478f4f032f47cf\" title=\"ZFC_MTSubterm\">MTSubterm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b30f1eee99e1c728\" href=\"?note=b30f1eee99e1c728\" title=\"ZFC_TBase\">TBase</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CNodes E U)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CConstraints","status":"resolved","id":"d1838ae56b7f2fbc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CConstraints|CConstraints]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MTSubterm|MTSubterm]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Finite","status":"resolved","id":"ee0b315916cb8bff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CConstraints|CConstraints]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MTSubterm|MTSubterm]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MTSubterm","status":"resolved","id":"98478f4f032f47cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CConstraints|CConstraints]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MTSubterm|MTSubterm]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num0","status":"resolved","id":"e8cec2782b4668b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CConstraints|CConstraints]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MTSubterm|MTSubterm]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TB